[00:01.87]Time feels like it's slipping away from me
{"时间仿佛正从我指缝间溜走"}
[00:08.23]Rewind to the days where we ran free
{"倒带回我们自由奔跑的时光"}
[00:15.46]Locked in where these colors fade back to gray
{"困在色彩褪回灰白的牢笼里"}
[00:21.93]But hold on 'cause I'm going to break away
{"但请坚持 因为我即将挣脱"}
[00:26.37]I hear you calling for
{"我听见你在呼唤"}
[00:28.17]me to lead my lights out and see through
{"让我点亮光芒穿透迷雾"}
[00:32.56]a sky that's bright now to meet you
{"此刻明亮的天际只为遇见你"}
[00:35.88]and make the stars come out
{"让繁星重现夜空"}
[00:39.97]Could I fix these
{"能否修复这些"}
[00:42.41]Lost and fragmented pieces
{"迷失破碎的残片"}
[00:45.85]of forgotten hope that I needed
{"那些被我遗忘的必需希望"}
[00:49.01]and pretend they're not all gone?
{"假装它们尚未全部消逝？"}
[00:53.38]Now I'm caught up in daydreams
{"此刻我沉溺于白日梦中"}
[00:59.46]I'm falling down into this starlight stream
{"坠入这条星光流淌的溪流"}
[01:06.20]I didn't think that I would rather be high,
{"未曾想过我竟会渴望翱翔"}
[01:13.73]in skies that feel so far away from me
{"在那遥不可及的天际彼端"}
[01:19.15]Yeah, I'll make an escape
{"是的 我将逃离此地"}
[01:21.88]
[02:27.46]Float back to these oceans where I fall asleep
{"飘回令我安眠的海洋怀抱"}
[02:34.26]I swim up even though I drown into the deep
{"纵使沉入深渊仍奋力上浮"}
[02:40.88]Lights flick as the pendulum ceases swings
{"钟摆停摆时灯光明灭闪烁"}
[02:47.62]It's only seconds 'til these walls cave in
{"崩塌前只剩最后几秒时间"}
[02:51.59]I'm asking you to help wake me
{"恳求你将我从噩梦中唤醒"}
[02:54.87]from these nightmares and save me
{"拯救我脱离这片苦痛深渊"}
[02:58.23]let my thoughts fade away to memories
{"让思绪化作有意义的回忆"}
[03:01.43]that all made perfect sense
{"这一切都合情合理"}
[03:05.68]Hypnotize me,
{"让我沉醉，"}
[03:08.28]this twilight where I can think clear
{"在这能清晰思考的暮色里"}
[03:11.39]and make this wish that you'll be here
{"许下心愿愿你在此"}
[03:14.70]to stop these falling tears
{"止住这些滑落的泪滴"}
[03:19.55]Now I'm caught up in daydreams
{"此刻我沉溺于白日梦中"}
[03:25.43]I'm falling down into this starlight stream
{"坠入这片星光的河流"}
[03:31.71]I didn't think that I would rather be high,
{"未曾想过我宁愿飘向高空"}
[03:39.28]in skies that feel so far away from me
{"在那遥不可及的天际"}
[03:44.92]Yeah, I'll make an escape
{"是的　我将逃离此地"}
